From 4dde8e0d185dc4a2ae76e29da6030878465ebb21 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:08:55 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: memory keys in landscape and other sizes with the "(
 )" key

The 3x5 and 4x4 function pads are shared between sizes whose operator pad
has the "( )" key and sizes whose pad does not. Both pairs now sit in the
brackets' cells; per size bucket, styles show MR/M+ where the operator pad
is two columns (has "( )") and the brackets elsewhere. versionCode 41.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017VXjYUWzBqMCeUoJD2Suc4
